  "notable_quotes": [
    "DMF diffusion rate controls ZnMOF-1 fate: slow DMF diffusion forms a water-stable MOF with enhanced water adsorption, but fast DMF-water exchange causes decomposition.",
    "After 48 h water treatment, water uptake rises from 150.0 to 228.9 cm3/g, while CO2 capacity drops to below 5 cm3/g.",
    "A minor fraction of ZnMOF-1 instead undergoes structural collapse and dissolution of MOF constituents in water."
